惑的眨了眨眼，自己应该是死了才对，从那么高的顶楼掉落，不粉身碎骨才怪。可是这是怎么回事？就在她疑惑的功夫里，一股不属于她的记忆，源源不断的涌入她的脑海中，她头疼的抬手揉了揉太阳穴。就在这时，门吱呀一声打了开来，苏小沫纠结的望去，见门口站着一个手捧破碗身着破旧粗布衫的妇人，见到她后，面露惊喜。“凡儿，你可算醒了，为娘担心死了，快躺下。”妇人进了屋将手中的碗放到床边，扶着她躺下，为她盖好棉被，满是褶皱的脸上因着激动，爬满了泪珠。苏小沫皱眉看着她，接收了那股记忆，她知道自己或许是灵魂穿越了，穿到了跟自己一般从高处摔下的苏小凡体内。而此刻眼前的妇人，便是苏小凡的娘亲——贾氏。“那个……”苏小沫张了张嘴，想要说点什么来安慰安慰她，却发现自己说出口的声音异常的沙哑，而且喉咙也很痛。“凡儿不要说话了，你都昏迷了四五日了，一直高烧不退，眼下好不容易烧退了，你好好休息，为娘去给你弄点粥。”贾氏站起身，匆匆忙忙的小跑了出去。苏小沫看的心都提到嗓子眼了，挺着那么大的肚子，走那么快真的没问题吗？记得姐姐以前快生产的时候，走路都得让人扶着。在她走后，苏小沫又坐起了身子，四下打量了起来，坑坑洼洼不平整泥巴做成的墙壁，屋内就只有如今她睡的床，外加一个破旧的柜子，再无别的物件。转头看了一下身旁放的正冒着热气的破碗，之所以称之为破碗，是因为它缺了好几个口子，碗中盛着黑乎乎的不知名的水，面上还漂浮着几片残渣。就在她看着那碗东西出神的功夫，贾氏又折返了回来，笑着说：“你看为娘这记性，都忘记喂你喝药了，来，趁着还没冷掉，赶紧喝了吧。”苏小沫心道，原来那是药啊。乖顺的接过喝了下去，涩涩的，倒没有喝出什么药味儿，可能是已经煮过很多次的了。纠结了片刻，苏小沫才结结巴巴的问出了口“那个，娘，你身子不便，还是我自己去弄吃的吧。”虽是这样说，苏小沫此刻也清楚，家里恐怕已经没有什么能吃的东西了。“你还是好好休息吧，你奶奶去买东西了，一会儿就回来，锅里已经烧上了水。”贾氏面露愧疚，犹豫了半天才说：“凡儿啊，你也不要怪为娘跟你奶奶，实在是没钱给你抓药跟买吃的，所以才……”“你被他们抬回来的时候，为娘都快吓死了，家里又没钱给你抓药，又没有吃的，之后张家的人送来了些碎银子，说是退亲的赔礼钱，云松已经去京城了，据说是决定要入赘贵人家了，怪只怪为娘跟你爹当年看错云松那孩子了。”苏小沫经她这一说，就明白了来龙去脉，刚还在疑惑奶奶怎会有钱去买吃的呢，想那张云松知道她还没死居然能安心的离开，就不怕她苏小凡出去闹的人尽皆知吗？“没事，既然给了，就收着吧。”白给的银子，不拿白不拿，反正眼下家里都没米下锅了，而且现在的她并非苏小凡，压根就不会伤心。“嗯，凡儿长大懂事了。”贾氏会心一笑，才端着碗转身走了出去。苏小沫只觉得全身酸软无力，反正也无事可干，所幸躺下休息，不多一会儿便睡了过去。昏昏沉沉的睡了不知多久，隐隐约约的闻到些许米饭的香味，苏小沫缓缓睁开眼，就见床边站着一位年迈的老奶奶，此人是苏小凡的奶奶——叶氏。“凡儿醒了，来，把这碗粥喝了。”叶氏见她醒来，慈爱的笑着，将手中的碗递了过去。“嗯。”苏小沫也着实饿了，照她们说的，自己昏迷了好几日的话，那么就是有好几日未进食了啊，坐起身，几口便将一碗粥喝掉了。“还要吗？奶奶再去给你盛一碗。”叶氏接过碗，颤颤巍巍的准备转身走出去。吃了点东西下去，加之又睡了一会儿，苏小沫觉得舒服多了，忙掀开薄被下床扶住了她：“奶奶，你年纪大了，还是休息会儿吧，我等下自己去盛就好。”叶氏闻言，也不多说，坐在床边休息了，奔波了这一大早，着实累坏她这把老骨头了。“娘呢？”苏小沫很担心贾氏，怎么说也是即将生产的人，想起她那严重营养不良的脸色，还有过瘦的身子，如何能安好的生下腹中孩子。“在院外呢？”说起这个，叶氏又慌忙站了起来，对着苏小沫说：“凡儿啊，你好好休息，奶奶出去看看你娘亲。”苏小沫不明所以的点了点头，刚刚如果没有看错的话，她从那老奶奶的眼中看到了一丝慌乱。目送她走出去后，苏小沫准备躺回去再休息休息，身体可是革命的本钱，养好身子后，再去想接下来的事情好了，既来之则安之。“你们在干什么？”叶氏才走到院子里，就见到俩个妇人正抓住贾氏的手，在她身上一通翻找。“娘。”贾氏努力挣扎了几下，也没有从她们的钳制中挣脱。叶氏看了她一眼，走过去，对那几个凶巴巴的妇人轻声说道：“二娃他娘，四喜他娘，你们这是在做什么呢？芷烟现在身子已经上了月份，同是女人，怎如此为难她。”闻言，两位妇人对视了一下，犹豫了片刻松开了紧捏住贾氏的手。“娘，是大嫂她不守信在前，说好的，我们借钱帮大哥下葬，你们有钱了就还我们。”二娃他娘李氏体型偏壮，加之人胖，看去比一般男子块头还要大，声音也粗里粗气的。“芷烟的确说过这样的话，但是现在我们还拿不出那笔钱……”叶氏面露愧色，这都怪自己，执意在一夫死去的时候，想要给他买一口棺材，让他踏踏实实的上路，才会欠下那么多的钱，对于没有了一夫这个唯一支柱的家庭来说，那可是笔天价。“张家不是有给小凡一笔退亲钱吗，大嫂为何没有拿出来先还我们一些。”四喜他娘孟氏跟李氏一般体态宽裕，声音却比其要尖细一些，说完见叶氏的脸色不好看，又继续说道：“娘啊，不是我们催得紧，我们也是要养家糊口的啊。”“养家糊口？二夫跟三夫赚的钱还不够养家吗？何时需要你们操心了，你们这是想逼死芷烟吗？那点碎银子可是凡儿的救命钱啊。”叶氏上前扶过贾氏，这孩子自从一夫走了，人也日渐消瘦，加上这次凡儿的事，真怕她会撑不住。“……”李氏跟孟氏自知理亏，却还是不想就这样空手而归，眼尖的看到正从屋内缓缓走出来的苏小凡，李氏粗声叫了起来：“娘，小凡这不是醒过来了吗？”－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－咳咳~！新文求收~！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/chongfuchengyin-nongjiatongyangxi/1.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 1 On the smoke-filled cliff passing through the farmhouse, a man in rich clothes stood on the edge of the cliff with his hands behind his hands. Behind him stood a thin girl in ragged clothes, trying her best to suppress the sobs that kept escaping from her mouth. The man's brows were full of impatience, and he turned to look at the girl with disgust: \"I've said everything I need to say, and I'm leaving.\" The girl reached out and grabbed his sleeve, choking and saying, \"I don't want...\" The man glanced sideways at the sleeve she grabbed. The look of disgust in her eyes was even worse, and she tried hard to restrain her emotions about to go berserk: \"Now that you and I are not in the same family, Fan'er, just let me live.\" The girl looked at his decisive back in disbelief, and he said, let him live. But now that I have no one to rely on except him, who will give me a way out? He reluctantly tugged on his sleeves and burst into tears: \"No, Fan'er, don't break off the engagement with you. Fan'er can become your wife in another year. You said you would help me take care of my grandma and mother.\" The man was silent for a moment, took out a small bag of broken silver, turned around and handed it to her: \"Here's this silver for you, should I You should be able to survive until your mother gives birth. As long as you agree to terminate the engagement.\" Without waiting for the girl to reply, the man reached out from her neck and pulled the engagement token he had given to her family since she was a child. As long as he gets this back, outsiders will believe him. The engagement between them has been terminated, and he can join the prime minister's family and prosper from then on. The girl reacted and took his hand: \"Brother Yunsong, you can't do this. If the engagement is terminated, Fan'er's life will be over.\" The man could no longer suppress the disgust in his heart, waved his hand vigorously, and pushed her away without intending to use too much force... \"Brother Yunsong, save me...\" The girl who was pushed to the edge of the cliff grabbed a plant on the edge of the cliff with all her strength, and her whole body was already hanging in the air. Panic flashed across the man's handsome face, and he strode forward, trying to pull her up, but stopped when he was about to touch her skinny arm. He knew her, and even if he got the engagement token back, she would definitely make a fuss, which would be detrimental to him. After pondering for a moment, he reached out and held her hand. After she let go of the plant with joy in her eyes, he cruelly let go of his hand and watched her fall into the misty valley. \"...\" Su Xiaomo sat up in sudden fright. He glanced at the thin quilt covering him, which was covered with patches and tatters, and blinked in confusion. He must be dead. It would be strange if he didn't fall to pieces after falling from such a high attic. But what's going on? While she was confused, a stream of memories that did not belong to her poured into her mind. She raised her hand to rub her temples with a headache. At this moment, the door creaked open. Su Xiaomo looked around in confusion and saw a woman standing at the door holding a broken bowl and wearing a shabby coarse shirt. When she saw her, her face showed surprise. \"Fan'er, you're finally awake. You're worried about your mother. Lie down quickly.\" The woman entered the room and put the bowl in her hand beside the bed. She helped her lie down and covered her with a quilt. Her wrinkled face was covered with tears due to excitement. Su Xiaomo frowned and looked at her, accepting the memory. She knew that her soul might have traveled through time and entered the body of Su Xiaofan, who had fallen from a height like her. The woman in front of her at this moment is Su Xiaofan's mother, Mrs. Jia. \"Well...\" Su Xiaomo opened her mouth, wanting to say something to comfort her, but found that her voice was unusually hoarse and her throat hurt. \"Fan'er, stop talking. You've been in a coma for four or five days. You have a high fever. Now it's finally gone. Have a good rest and go get some porridge for your mother.\" Jia stood up and trotted out in a hurry. Su Xiaomo's heart was in her throat. With such a big belly, is it really okay to walk so fast? I remember that when my sister was about to give birth, she had to be supported when walking. After she left, Su Xiaomo sat up again and looked around. The walls were uneven and made of mud. The only thing in the house was the bed she was sleeping on, plus a shabby cabinet, and no other objects. He turned around and looked at the steaming broken bowl beside him. It was called a broken bowl because it had several holes missing. The bowl was filled with dark, unknown water, with a few pieces of debris floating on the surface. Just when she was looking at the bowl of food, Jia came back and said with a smile: \"Look at my memory, I have forgotten to give you medicine. Come on, drink it before it gets cold.\" Su Xiaomo thought to herself, it turned out to be medicine. He took it obediently and drank it. It was astringent but didn't taste like medicine. It might have been cooked many times. After struggling for a moment, Su Xiaomo stammered and asked, \"Um, Mom, you are inconvenient, so I should go get food myself.\" Even though she said this, Su Xiaomo also knew at this moment that there was probably nothing edible at home. \"You'd better have a good rest. Your grandma went shopping and will be back soon. The water has been boiled in the pot.\" Mrs. Jia looked guilty and hesitated for a long time before saying, \"Fan'er, don't blame your mother and your grandma. They really don't have money to give you medicine and buy food, so...\" \"When you were brought back by them, my mother was almost scared to death. The family had no money to give you medicine and no food. After that, the Zhang family I brought some broken silver, saying it was compensation for breaking up the engagement. Yun Song has already gone to the capital. It is said that he has decided to marry into a noble family. It is only because my mother and your father were wrong about Yun Song's child back then.\" Su Xiaomo told her this. As soon as he said it, he understood the whole story. Just now he was wondering how his grandma could have money to buy food. I wonder if Zhang Yunsong could leave peacefully knowing that she was not dead yet. Wasn't he afraid that everyone would know that Su Xiaofan went out to cause trouble? \"It's okay, since", "title_en": "Chapter 1"}